      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Same issue. \nWhenever you try to build while having bakery and the sdk, it unticks realtime global illumination on build.\nIf you then remove the sdk, then build, everything works fine as expected. Lightmaps work, and the checkbox for realtime gi isn't affected.\nThis only happens for the udon sdk. So the 3.0 sdk is breaking realtime gi if used in conjunction with bakery, even if you've never used bakery to bake the lightmaps.",
